What:		/sys/class/drm/card*/device/gpu_mem_limit_pct
Date:		November 2026
Contact:	dri-devel@lists.freedesktop.org
Description:
		Write an unsigned integer. Values from 1 to 99 set the
		device-wide and per-client limits to that percentage of RAM.
		Zero and values of 100 or more disable both limits.

		The new limits apply to allocation requests. Existing
		allocations are not revoked. Values returned by earlier
		GET_PARAMS calls do not change; clients must query again.

		A read returns the current per-client limit as a percentage
		of RAM. Zero means no limit. Only the owner can write.
